# Web / Tailwind

- Follow [DESIGN.md](mdc:DESIGN.md) for tokens, spacing, and component patterns.
- Tailwind v4 project conventions — do not invent parallel token systems.
- UI depends on API/DTO contracts, not Python infrastructure modules.
- Prefer existing components and hooks under `web/src/` before new abstractions.

Verification when UI behavior matters: attach `53-mcp-playwright` or run existing web tests if the job specifies them.
